<Table cellpadding=4>
<tr>
<td width=50% valign=top><pre>
<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-family:Arial;color:black'>










XVIII ALPHABET

Astres, brutes chaussées d'effrois, frêles granules,
Hautains, incendiez, joyaux, kriss lumineux,
Mais n'osez pas que rois souterrains, ténébreux,
Ululant vers wadi, xènes y zinzinulent!

27 juillet 1992

</pre></b>
Copyright Michel Galiana  01.04.2006 (c) (r) All rights reserved
</p></td>
<td width=50% valign=top><pre>
<p class=MsoNormal><b><span style='font-family:Arial;color:black'>










XVIII ALPHABET

A brightly coloured day encouraging freely
Great hordes in joyfully knowable lavishness
May not order people queer rogues so to upset
Vainly with xenophobe yesterday's zealotry.

July 27th 1992

</pre></b>
"Transl." Christian Souchon  01.04.2006 (c) (r) All rights reserved
</p></td></tr>
</table>
